{"name":"03-Heretic","date":"2006-04-23T17:01:44.000Z","clearFrame":false,"components":[{"type":"Comment","group":"Misc","text":"______________________________________________________\r\n| Heretic -------------------------------------------------- Inflamed Sickness [03/13] |\r\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\r\nI made this AVS for listening to slipknot and the like\r\nFor some reason the blood doesn't work if you started the AVS window with this AVS, so you'll have to reload it if you do.\r\nEnable the two texts after the water for song info crap\r\n\r\nThe blood streaks look best at 320x240.\r\nSome times the blood moves really slow, to fix this you have to restart the avs plug in (close the window, re-open it)\r\nIf the blood looks crappy then turn off the last effect list.\r\n\r\nFor some different effects set the output blending on  the last effects list to subtractive2 (you'll need some blood for this) or xor.\r\n\r\nBlah blah blah...\r\nDon't go killing any one or self harming!\r\n______________________________________________________\r\n| Quiche_on_a_leash --------------- quiche_on_a_leash@hotmail.co.uk |\r\n| ------------------ What the hell did I do to deserve all of this ------------------ |\r\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯"},{"type":"ColorModifier","group":"Trans","recomputeEveryFrame":true,"code":{"init":"","perFrame":"","onBeat":"","perPoint":"red=red*.75;green=0;blue=0"}},{"type":"Movement","group":"Trans","output":"Replace","sourceMapped":false,"bilinear":true,"wrap":false,"code":"x=y;\r\n\r\n"},{"type":"DynamicMovement","group":"Trans","code":{"init":"","perFrame":"","onBeat":"dr = (rand(100) / 100) * $PI;\r\nd = d * .95;","perPoint":"r = r + dr;"},"bFilter":true,"coord":"POLAR","gridW":2,"gridH":2,"blend":false,"wrap":true,"buffer":0,"alphaOnly":false},{"type":"Scatter","group":"Trans","enabled":true},{"type":"SetRenderMode","group":"Misc","blend":"REPLACE","adjustBlend":0,"lineSize":7,"enabled":true}